### Feature Branch — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico (status = inactive)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@id = 1

# @name deleteBranchPhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/sucursales/{{id}}

###

# @name deleteBranchLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/sucursales/{{id}}/deactivate
